  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Afternoon Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    19 August 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good afternoon Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,187.88/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,200.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,175.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SOBAZ</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>TSL</td>\n                <td>₦1,185.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>LIQUID BULK</td>\n                <td>₦1,185.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MASTERS</td>\n                <td>₦1,185.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SIGMUND</td>\n                <td>₦1,185.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,198.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,649.38/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBETO</td>\n                <td>₦1,675.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ARADEL</td>\n                <td>₦1,600.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,580.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>T.TIME</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Chinese Tankers Turn Back as Strait of Hormuz Security Risks Rise\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Two Chinese-linked supertankers have reversed course around the Strait of Hormuz. The vessels, Sea V and Hestia, turned around after entering or approaching the waterway and are now waiting outside their original routes. The movements come after Reuters reported that two major Chinese state-owned shipping companies had already diverted vessels away from the Strait.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/chinese-tankers-turn-back-as-strait-of-hormuz-security-risks-rise\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Brent Crude Rises for Straight Four Days as U.S.-Iran Crisis Lingers\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Brent crude was trading at $91.63 a barrel, up 0.67 per cent, while West Texas Intermediate, WTI, stood at $85.62 a barrel. The sustained rise reflects growing concern among market participants over the possibility of prolonged disruption to crude shipments through the strategic waterway.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/brent-crude-rises-for-straight-four-days-as-us-iran-crisis-lingers\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    PETROAN Sets Crude Supply Conditions for Port Harcourt, Warri Refinery Restart\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Petroleum Products Retail Outlets Owners Association of Nigeria, PETROAN, has called for guaranteed crude oil supply before the planned restart of the Port Harcourt and Warri refineries. The association said the success of the refineries should be judged by their ability to operate consistently and profitably, rather than by commissioning ceremonies or the mere resumption of production.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/petroan-sets-crude-supply-conditions-for-port-harcourt-warri-refinery-restart\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump Rules Out Iran Talks as Strait of Hormuz Crisis Deepens\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump has said there are no ongoing or scheduled talks with Iran. Trump, in a post on Truth Social on Tuesday, also maintained that the Strait of Hormuz was open and operating, despite Iran insisting that the strategic waterway remained closed.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-rules-out-iran-talks-as-strait-of-hormuz-crisis-deepens\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Attracts $1bn Funding Support Ahead of IPO\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals has secured a $1 billion underwriting programme. The programme consists of a $600 million private placement that has been underwritten and funded and a further $400 million underwriting commitment for the proposed IPO.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-attracts-1bn-funding-support-ahead-of-ipo\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
